{"3026770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hunt Me", "steam_appid": 3026770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HUNT ME</strong> is an immersive 1-4 player co-op horror survival game. Enter cursed locations, gather ingredients for an ancient ritual, and weaken demonic entities using infrared technology. But remember: in this hunt, <strong>you are also the prey.</strong></p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026770/extras/8712dd95b8d2aa08d8e5fba8719dc236.poster.avif?t=1786266338\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026770/extras/8712dd95b8d2aa08d8e5fba8719dc236.webm?t=1786266338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026770/extras/8712dd95b8d2aa08d8e5fba8719dc236.mp4?t=1786266338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE THE HUNT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master high-tech gear and tactical awareness to stay alive in the dark:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Infrared Vision:</strong> Track invisible threats, reveal hidden clues, and expose entity weaknesses.<br></li><li> <strong>Tactical Choices:</strong> Stealthily navigate around hostile anomalies or confront them directly with your infrared flashlights.<br></li><li> <strong>The Banishment Ritual:</strong> Locate volatile ingredients scattered across the map to cleanse the realm before time runs out.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026770/extras/195b86822d501558d744c9611a1934e6.poster.avif?t=1786266338\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026770/extras/195b86822d501558d744c9611a1934e6.webm?t=1786266338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026770/extras/195b86822d501558d744c9611a1934e6.mp4?t=1786266338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HIGH REPLAYABILITY &amp; UNPREDICTABLE AI</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two hunts are ever the same. Ritual components, cursed bones, safe zones, and deadly traps are procedurally randomized every match. The dynamic entity AI adapts to your noise, location, and tactics—keeping you on edge at all times.</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026770/extras/0053c1c4c2f4a2f29ca566e7625d84fb.poster.avif?t=1786266338\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026770/extras/0053c1c4c2f4a2f29ca566e7625d84fb.webm?t=1786266338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026770/extras/0053c1c4c2f4a2f29ca566e7625d84fb.mp4?t=1786266338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ADAPTIVE DIFFICULTY &amp; CUSTOMIZATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you are looking for a suspenseful exploration or a relentless nightmare, adjust the experience to your playstyle:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>6 Difficulty Presets:</strong> From beginner-friendly investigations to hardcore survival scenarios requiring flawless coordination.<br></li><li> <strong>100% Custom Mode:</strong> Fine-tune AI aggression, item spawn rates, stamina, and environmental hazards.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026770/extras/8c1e9d0fad0380043518900ad3d98631.poster.avif?t=1786266338\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026770/extras/8c1e9d0fad0380043518900ad3d98631.webm?t=1786266338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026770/extras/8c1e9d0fad0380043518900ad3d98631.mp4?t=1786266338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY YOUR WAY: SOLO OR CO-OP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the darkness alone or assemble a team of up to 4 players. Playing solo demands extreme precision, stealth, and resource management, while co-op rewards communication, role assignment, and split-second teamwork.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HUNT ME</strong> is an immersive 1-4 player co-op horror survival game. Enter cursed locations, gather ingredients for an ancient ritual, and weaken demonic entities using infrared technology. But remember: in this hunt, <strong>you are also the prey.</strong></p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026770/extras/8712dd95b8d2aa08d8e5fba8719dc236.poster.avif?t=1786266338\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026770/extras/8712dd95b8d2aa08d8e5fba8719dc236.webm?t=1786266338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026770/extras/8712dd95b8d2aa08d8e5fba8719dc236.mp4?t=1786266338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE THE HUNT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master high-tech gear and tactical awareness to stay alive in the dark:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Infrared Vision:</strong> Track invisible threats, reveal hidden clues, and expose entity weaknesses.<br></li><li> <strong>Tactical Choices:</strong> Stealthily navigate around hostile anomalies or confront them directly with your infrared flashlights.<br></li><li> <strong>The Banishment Ritual:</strong> Locate volatile ingredients scattered across the map to cleanse the realm before time runs out.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026770/extras/195b86822d501558d744c9611a1934e6.poster.avif?t=1786266338\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026770/extras/195b86822d501558d744c9611a1934e6.webm?t=1786266338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026770/extras/195b86822d501558d744c9611a1934e6.mp4?t=1786266338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HIGH REPLAYABILITY &amp; UNPREDICTABLE AI</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two hunts are ever the same. Ritual components, cursed bones, safe zones, and deadly traps are procedurally randomized every match. The dynamic entity AI adapts to your noise, location, and tactics—keeping you on edge at all times.</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026770/extras/0053c1c4c2f4a2f29ca566e7625d84fb.poster.avif?t=1786266338\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026770/extras/0053c1c4c2f4a2f29ca566e7625d84fb.webm?t=1786266338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026770/extras/0053c1c4c2f4a2f29ca566e7625d84fb.mp4?t=1786266338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ADAPTIVE DIFFICULTY &amp; CUSTOMIZATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you are looking for a suspenseful exploration or a relentless nightmare, adjust the experience to your playstyle:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>6 Difficulty Presets:</strong> From beginner-friendly investigations to hardcore survival scenarios requiring flawless coordination.<br></li><li> <strong>100% Custom Mode:</strong> Fine-tune AI aggression, item spawn rates, stamina, and environmental hazards.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026770/extras/8c1e9d0fad0380043518900ad3d98631.poster.avif?t=1786266338\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026770/extras/8c1e9d0fad0380043518900ad3d98631.webm?t=1786266338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026770/extras/8c1e9d0fad0380043518900ad3d98631.mp4?t=1786266338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY YOUR WAY: SOLO OR CO-OP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the darkness alone or assemble a team of up to 4 players. Playing solo demands extreme precision, stealth, and resource management, while co-op rewards communication, role assignment, and split-second teamwork.</p>", "short_description": "HUNT ME is a first-person co-op horror survival game for 1-4 players. Experience an atmospheric online co-op multiplayer hunt: gather ritual ingredients, use infrared vision to weaken demonic threats and banish them before becoming the prey!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Bulgarian, Traditional Chinese, Korean, Danish, Spanish - Latin America, Finnish, Greek, Hungarian, Indonesian, Malay, Norwegian, Dutch, Portuguese - Brazil, Romanian, Swedish, Czech, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": 